+# Plan
+
+1. Change cart hydration in `ShoppingCartServiceImpl` to identify missing-SKU items, remove their child attributes and remove the items from the persisted cart, without marking the cart obsolete or deleting it. Preserve the existing repricing and availability refresh for surviving products.
+2. Ensure the modern cart mapper only serializes hydrated items with a live product and always calculates totals/quantity from the surviving set, including an empty cart.
+3. Preserve the existing missing-product validation in all cart-add paths and verify it produces `ResourceNotFoundException`/HTTP 404 for deleted SKUs.
+4. Keep order reads snapshot-based: retain SKU/name/quantity/price/subtotal from `OrderProduct`, and allow the optional live-product enrichment to be absent. Update checkout inventory decrement to resolve by SKU and skip inventory adjustment when the product is already gone.
+5. Add or update focused unit/integration tests for cart cleanup, empty-cart totals, deleted-product add rejection, order snapshot rendering, checkout, and v2 SKU lookup if the repository’s test fixtures support them.
+6. Run formatting/compilation and the relevant Maven test suites, then inspect the diff and report any verification gaps.
